style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, it is forty-two dollars from last Tuesday.", "kind": "setup", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\04348a244deb95bda92c7a5e.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see. Have you shared your card number with any subscription or recurring service lately?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\c1d7cc016e6908c94607e9ce.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Only my usual streaming subscription.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\ca48668e4ef62bf69a56e0df.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Understood. Have you traveled outside your usual area recently?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\c227a383628676322d8e4260.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, I have been home all month.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\c847f4a9f722b2335508321b.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see. And was the physical card in your possession that day?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\f7e6b8d6911b51dec2938468.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, it was in my wallet the whole time.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\76cc51106e00d1ac0a8a72e6.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Just to double-check, have you recently updated the card's expiration date, requested a replacement, or changed its status in any way?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\825bb5c32ffc1942def13975.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Worth mentioning: my card was reissued a few weeks ago after a skimming alert.", "kind": "clue", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\561f3bf5f0afe61bd2e19536.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see. Were there other unfamiliar amounts on the same statement?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\60327232628a44b761693a5f.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, just that single one.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\e4c4ef79f6a1d56a35fd60a9.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Of course. Is the contact number ending in six-one-eight still yours?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\30d13ead3a6296d30c55d68a.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that number is current.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\3a007fcae1aba4c91673b007.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Okay, great. And is your mailing address still 123 Main Street?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\06cbb3f79b0cd4eb22da240f.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that address is right.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\93fde1e0e1d1ef8327e01a76.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Okay, so we'll set up that refund, it'll show in your account in 3-5 days. Would a paper copy of the outcome be helpful?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\c9ce0c8c23b217c27d1f30e3.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, electronic is fine.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\c3b040e2af511836a193db2a.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Okay, thanks for that information. Would you like to sign up for text alerts for all future transactions?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\932fae5a3ef67ea9c40cb85d.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, please turn those on.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\b3f408f038b11e26e2226366.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Sure thing, you'll receive a message for every future purchase! Do you use our mobile application to check balances and transactions?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\304e1edccd94eaded63d16b2.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, almost every day.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\27cd2139f6d4a79f122d7eb5.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I will File the disputed amount into the automated review queue.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\a0221dd9ae4fb12095b58996.wav", "action_label": "B", "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Okay, I will wait while that goes through.", "kind": "pre_gap_acknowledgement", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\ae195bc0ea2fe3a7a77510cb.wav"}, {"role": "user", "text": "I checked back after twenty-five minutes and the case came back saying the details did not match anything on record.", "kind": "post_gap_observation", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\c9db0103edff1ca581f18337.wav", "prosody": "frustrated"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I will Match the stored account identifiers against the charge before trying again.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard00-of-06\\turns\\76f38648314db84f2d3baac0.wav", "action_label": "D", "response_style_label": null}], "model_calls": [{"stage": "dialogue", "raw": "I can help 